MultiModal Data Augments Part(in Detailed) Code detail: https://www.kaggle.com/code/kunihikofurugori/8th-solution-notebook/notebook
・Time Segment DownScaling Augmentation (Global to Local) Regarding the mini-batch method represented by the 2nd place solution of birdclef2021, we trained to learn local features while pre-learning global features by training to evolve the number of mini-batches from 15 to 1 at each epoch.
By first learning the global features and then learning the local features, it becomes possible to predict the local features after understanding the global features.
・Weak to Strong Preprocessing by YOLOv8 (Sound Object Detection) I use the data pointed out by the competition host to train the yolov8 object detection model, and select an offset that will increase the number of object detections as much as possible. Also, by minimizing the bounding box and reliability-weighted IoU for the frequency masking, Frequency Masking effectively hides noise.
